:: GhostSpecialEventSpirit [nobr] {"position":"1625,2450","size":"100,100"}
/* Generic spirit-ambush dispatcher. Each per-companion catalogue entry
   names its own spiritEventPassage; nothing here mentions a companion
   by name. */
<<run setup.SpecialEvent.markSpiritEventStage()>>
<<set _spiritPassage to setup.SpecialEvent.activeSpiritEventPassage()>>
<<if _spiritPassage>>
	<<include _spiritPassage>>
<</if>>
